> explain (verbose, costs off)
> select * from a16_i8 i8 left join lateral
>   (select *, i8.q2 from a16_i4 where false) ss on true
QUERY PLAN:text
Nested Loop Left Join
  Output: i8.q1, i8.q2, f1, (i8.q2)
  Join Filter: false
  ->  Seq Scan on public.a16_i8 i8
        Output: i8.q1, i8.q2
  ->  Result
        Output: f1, i8.q2
        One-Time Filter: false
-- EXPLAIN

> explain (verbose, costs off)
> select * from a16_i8 i8 left join lateral
>   (select *, i8.q2 from a16_i4 i1, a16_i4 i2 where false) ss on true
QUERY PLAN:text
Nested Loop Left Join
  Output: i8.q1, i8.q2, f1, f1, (i8.q2)
  ->  Seq Scan on public.a16_i8 i8
        Output: i8.q1, i8.q2
  ->  Result
        Output: f1, f1, i8.q2
        One-Time Filter: false
-- EXPLAIN

> explain (verbose, costs off)
> select * from a16_i8 a left join (select * from a16_i4 where false) ss on ss.f1 = a.q1
QUERY PLAN:text
Hash Left Join
  Output: a.q1, a.q2, f1
  Hash Cond: (a.q1 = f1)
  Join Filter: false
  ->  Seq Scan on public.a16_i8 a
        Output: a.q1, a.q2
  ->  Hash
        Output: f1
        ->  Result
              Output: f1
              One-Time Filter: false
-- EXPLAIN

