> explain (verbose, costs off)
> select * from a16_i8 a left join (select * from a16_i4 where false) ss on ss.f1 = a.q1 and a.q2 > 0
QUERY PLAN:text
Hash Left Join
  Output: a.q1, a.q2, f1
  Hash Cond: (a.q1 = f1)
  Join Filter: (false AND (a.q2 > 0))
  ->  Seq Scan on public.a16_i8 a
        Output: a.q1, a.q2
  ->  Hash
        Output: f1
        ->  Result
              Output: f1
              One-Time Filter: false
-- EXPLAIN

> explain (verbose, costs off)
> select * from (select * from a16_i4 where false) ss right join a16_i8 a on true
